canvas 33, margin 2, background #ffffff

guard margin : raised from 1 to 2 modules
warning eye-rotation top-left: outer eye turned 20 degrees off a quarter turn
warning eye-rotation top-right: outer eye turned 20 degrees off a quarter turn
warning eye-rotation bottom-left: outer eye turned 20 degrees off a quarter turn

